WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV — gates (30s) Narrator George

1
00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:03.572
When an AI agent deletes data or sends money,

2
00:00:03.572 --> 00:00:07.692
guessing with a giant model and apologizing later fails.

3
00:00:08.112 --> 00:00:10.240
Metered Commit Gates puts a fast,

4
00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:15.784
cheap check in front of every irreversible side effect and escalates only when needed.

5
00:00:16.204 --> 00:00:21.936
On an AMD Kria KV260 board with an INA260 rail sensor,

6
00:00:21.936 --> 00:00:27.455
one whole-module gate cycle reads 11,428 picojoules.

7
00:00:27.875 --> 00:00:30.773
Every decision either passes the check or logs

8
00:00:30.773 --> 00:00:33.607
a clean refusal receipt with its energy cost.
